; garbage_collector_demo.tscn — mark-and-sweep on a 6 x 6 heap, backed by
; garbage_collector_demo.gd. Root-set pillar at one edge, reference edges over a
; freshly generated object graph, and a five-phase clock: LIVE, DROP (one bridge
; reference cut), MARK (BFS from the roots), SWEEP (every cell visited, the
; unlit ones greyed into the free list), HOLD. Built procedurally in _ready();
; nothing is authored here.

